WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.625
Module 1: read-only discovery.

2
00:00:02.625 --> 00:00:06.125
An assessment team rarely gets
privileged access on day one.

3
00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:11.487
Authorization paperwork, security review
and trust between teams all take time.

4
00:00:11.487 --> 00:00:14.072
The program spends that
window learning what

5
00:00:14.072 --> 00:00:16.588
the directory already
tells every employee.

6
00:00:16.588 --> 00:00:20.259
A standard domain account, with
no rights beyond the default,

7
00:00:20.259 --> 00:00:23.050
can read most of what
the migration plan needs.

8
00:00:23.050 --> 00:00:27.768
Starting there changes nothing in the
directory, applies least privilege,

9
00:00:27.768 --> 00:00:33.779
NIST SP 800-53 control AC-6,
to the assessment team itself,

10
00:00:33.779 --> 00:00:37.507
and turns the request for
elevated access into a list built

11
00:00:37.507 --> 00:00:41.380
from evidence instead of a
general request for Domain Admin.
